# Transition pages between chapters (src/zscript/rf/comics.zs). One scene per transition:
#   scene <ID> <FROM MAP> <TO MAP> <page image, 1920 x 1080, art without text>
#   panel <x> <y> <w> <h>                       (pixels of the page, in reading order)
#   caption <after panel> <$LANGUAGE key> <x> <y> <w> <h> [band]
#     (the text is composed by the game: on a cream box over the art, or with "band" in cream on the page's black band)
# A scene plays only when its page image is in the build; otherwise the chapter ends on its exit text as before.
# Pages delivered take the panels and zones of their planche.json; the others keep the common four-panel layout of
# the contract (large place, two details, the opening) until their page comes.

# Codex COMIC_RF01_RF02_01 (01/10), planche.json: four panels, one caption after the fourth, in the black band
scene RF01_RF02 RF01 RF02 graphics/comics/RF01_RF02.png
panel 0 0 797 954
panel 797 0 1123 411
panel 797 411 448 543
panel 1245 411 675 543
caption 4 $RF_COMIC_RF01_RF02_1 120 960 1680 65 band

